C1 choose: the cut after the snapshot's group, not at it: KILLED by test_on_a_recorded_pool, test_the_cut_at_or_after_the_group_and_the_one_before
C2 choose: cuts of later sessions count: KILLED by test_within_its_session
C3 choose: cuts of earlier sessions count: KILLED by test_the_middle_of_those_that_qualify, test_within_its_session
C4 choose: the early cut need not be usable: KILLED by test_only_cuts_that_may_be_used
C5 choose: the published cut need not be usable: KILLED by test_only_cuts_that_may_be_used
C6 choose: the first that qualifies, not the middle: KILLED by test_only_cuts_that_may_be_used
C7 choose: the last that qualifies: KILLED by test_the_middle_of_those_that_qualify
C8 choose: no check that a cut comes before: SURVIVED
C9 choose: the early cut may be of the snapshot's group or later: SURVIVED
C10 choose: the snapshot's session is not looked at: KILLED by test_the_middle_of_those_that_qualify, test_within_its_session
F1 read_snaps: a bad line is passed over: KILLED by test_snaps
F2 read_sums: a bad line is passed over: KILLED by test_sums
F3 read_sums: the digest and the name swapped: KILLED by test_sums
L1 later_uberblock: an uberblock before the instant counts: SURVIVED
L2 later_uberblock: the cut's own group counts: KILLED by test_later_uberblock
L3 later_uberblock: any group counts: KILLED by test_later_uberblock
B1 live_block: any level: KILLED by test_live_block
B2 live_block: any type: KILLED by test_live_block
B3 live_block: the offset without the labels: KILLED by test_live_block
B4 live_block: the last copy, not the first: KILLED by test_live_block
E1 EXPECTED: early may be missed: KILLED by test_every_control_must_be_caught
S1 spans_of: no session ends: KILLED by test_spans, test_within_its_session
V1 verify: a missing ref is not noticed: SURVIVED
V2 snapshot_files: a missing snapshot is not noticed: SURVIVED
V3 snapshot_files: the digests are not compared: SURVIVED
V4 snapshot_files: files the source did not hold are not noticed: SURVIVED
V5 verify: every copy is not checked: SURVIVED
V6 main: a control that is missed does not fail the run: SURVIVED
V7 main: the published cut's failure does not fail the run: SURVIVED
